# Trim the build context. The Containerfiles only COPY `build_files/` and
# `cosign.pub`, so everything else is dead weight in the context tarball.
# Most important: never let the gitignored private signing key leak into a build.
cosign.key

.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# Docs / metadata
*.md
LICENSE

# ISO / disk build configs (consumed by build-disk.yml, not the image build)
*.toml
disk_config/
examples/

# Contributor tooling (not used by CI builds)
Justfile
